WEBVTT

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:32.101
And then I called my husband,
and he rushed to find me

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:34.935
and I said all the true things
that I have known.

00:01:34.959 --> 00:01:38.019
I said, "I have loved you forever,

00:01:38.043 --> 00:01:39.707
I have loved you forever.

00:01:39.731 --> 00:01:41.715
I am so sorry.

00:01:41.739 --> 00:01:43.797
Please take care of our son."

00:01:44.806 --> 00:01:47.535
And then as I began
the walk to the hospital,

00:01:47.559 --> 00:01:50.502
it crossed my mind for the first time,

00:01:50.526 --> 00:01:53.261
"Oh. How ironic."

00:01:53.285 --> 00:01:56.725
I had just written
a book called "Blessed."

00:01:57.097 --> 00:01:59.097
(Laughter)